# Change the Equation, first mode: "Counter target spell with mana value 2 or less" (CR 202.3, 115.1) - any color. Bot2
# stacks Frantic Search (blue, mana value 3), then Diabolic Edict (black, mana value 2) above it. Bot1's first mode is not
# offered the mana value 3 spell (the refusal) and counters the Edict (the boundary), so Bot1 keeps its Ornithopter.
# Frantic Search resolves: Bot2 draws two and discards two.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Change the Equation
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Frantic Search
Diabolic Edict
Swamp x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Hand.Frantic Search.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Diabolic Edict.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Change the Equation.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1)
! Bot1.Target(Stack.Frantic Search)
Bot1.Target(Stack.Diabolic Edict)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Change the Equation
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 5
Bot2.Graveyard.Diabolic Edict.Colors.Count = 1
